  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the ViewModel**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in designing the `FitnessViewModel.kt`. My current focus is on seamlessly integrating the Room database with the Gemini AI service, speech recognition, daily deficit calculations, progressive overload advice, and multi-period history statistics. This ViewModel aims to be the central hub, tying all these components together for a comprehensive fitness application experience.\n\n\n**Defining State Flows**\n\nI\'ve been meticulously defining the state flows needed for the `FitnessViewModel`. I\'m focusing on granular data representation, including `selectedDate`, `selectedHistoryRange`, user profiles, workout and diet logs (both for selected dates and all-time), and AI-driven insights with their processing states. The goal is to provide a reactive, data-rich environment for the application.\n\n\n\n"
