  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the voice-based food logging system and the daily calorie deficit progress tracking engine:\n\n- **Voice Food Logging & Nutrient Calculation**:\n  - **Spoken Input Parsing**: Speak natural meal descriptions (e.g., *\"\344\270\255\345\215\210\345\220\203\344\272\206200\345\205\213\345\244\247\347\261\263\351\245\255\351\205\215200\345\205\213\351\270\241\350\203\270\350\202\211\345\222\214\344\270\200\347\233\230\346\260\264\347\205\256\350\245\277\345\205\260\350\212\261\"*). The system identifies individual items, parses gram quantities, and calculates the total caloric content along with protein, carbohydrates, and fats.\n  - **Itemized Confirmation Flow**: Displays the parsed voice text, individual food items with their calculated calories and gram breakdowns, and allows adjustment before saving to the local database.\n\n- **Calorie Deficit Progress Monitor**:\n  - **Dynamic Deficit Gauge**: Visualizes daily deficit progress against goals (`(TDEE + Workout Calories) - Food Intake = Net Deficit`), complete with an animated progress bar and status badges.\n  - **Remaining Budget Indicator**: Shows the remaining calories allowed for the day while maintaining the target deficit.\n\n- **Integrated Dashboard & History**:\n  - **Dashboard & Diet Screen Integration**: Live deficit gauges and meal logs are accessible on both the home dashboard and the dedicated Diet screen.\n  - **Multi-Period Analytics**: Track weekly, monthly, and yearly calorie deficit trends alongside progressive overload recommendations."
    modified_response: "I have implemented the voice-based food logging system and the daily calorie deficit progress tracking engine:\n\n- **Voice Food Logging & Nutrient Calculation**:\n  - **Spoken Input Parsing**: Speak natural meal descriptions (e.g., *\"\344\270\255\345\215\210\345\220\203\344\272\206200\345\205\213\345\244\247\347\261\263\351\245\255\351\205\215200\345\205\213\351\270\241\350\203\270\350\202\211\345\222\214\344\270\200\347\233\230\346\260\264\347\205\256\350\245\277\345\205\260\350\212\261\"*). The system identifies individual items, parses gram quantities, and calculates the total caloric content along with protein, carbohydrates, and fats.\n  - **Itemized Confirmation Flow**: Displays the parsed voice text, individual food items with their calculated calories and gram breakdowns, and allows adjustment before saving to the local database.\n\n- **Calorie Deficit Progress Monitor**:\n  - **Dynamic Deficit Gauge**: Visualizes daily deficit progress against goals (`(TDEE + Workout Calories) - Food Intake = Net Deficit`), complete with an animated progress bar and status badges.\n  - **Remaining Budget Indicator**: Shows the remaining calories allowed for the day while maintaining the target deficit.\n\n- **Integrated Dashboard & History**:\n  - **Dashboard & Diet Screen Integration**: Live deficit gauges and meal logs are accessible on both the home dashboard and the dedicated Diet screen.\n  - **Multi-Period Analytics**: Track weekly, monthly, and yearly calorie deficit trends alongside progressive overload recommendations."
